From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan <ryan@esterlines.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:17:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Farble WebGL2 MAX_* limits and unmasked renderer
 strings

Subtract 0 or 1 from Brave's twelve WebGL2 MAX_* getParameter values
using a per-pname stream from the ESO seed. UNMASKED_VENDOR_WEBGL and
UNMASKED_RENDERER_WEBGL are the fixed strings Xenon / Xenon Generic
Renderer. Extensions and Standard readPixels stay honest. Strict zeros
the farbled set and skips probe writes. The GPU process never sees the
seed.
